        "id": "s1",
        "title": {
          "en": "The sharp drawer",
          "hi": "तीखा दराज़"
        },
        "image": {
          "id": "vc1-tud-s1",
          "brief": "The ledger-spirit opening a small drawer with two fingers and lifting out a tiny silver needle; the Vetāla and Dādī leaning in to look; a pinprick of light at the needle's tip; firelight.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A drawer-spirit lifts a tiny silver needle from his body while a grey spirit and an old woman lean in",
            "hi": "दराज़ वाला भूत अपने शरीर से नन्ही चाँदी की सुई निकालता, पास झुके भूत और बुज़ुर्ग स्त्री"
